            "description": {
              "content": "Returns the site name, home URL, timezone, site icon and HAL `_links`. On dalcorpharma.com the `namespaces`, `authentication` and `routes` arrays are returned EMPTY — the root index is suppressed by the deployment. The per-namespace index at /wp/v2 is fully published, so discovery works there instead. Observed 2026-08-04.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
